{"url": "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/graduate/", "final_url": "https://www.uwo.ca/biology/graduate/", "status": 200, "method": "http", "fetched": "2026-10-24", "text": "Graduate Studies - Department of Biology - Western University\nSkip to Content\nPopular Links\nPopular Links\nDirectory\nMail\nOWL Brightspace\nStudent Services\nWebsites A - Z\nEvents\nLibraries\nMaps\nParking\nWesternU\nAbout Us\nAdministration\nBiology Department Plan\nPeople\nFaculty\nStaff\nCross-Appointed, Adjunct, and Part-time Faculty\nPost Doctoral\nGraduate Students\nEmeritus\nUndergraduate\nFuture Students\nCurrent Students\nStudent Life\nStudent Perspectives\nGraduate\nResearch Opportunities\nResources for Biology Graduate Supervisors\nFuture Students\nCurrent Students\nStudent Life\nSOBGS\nResearch\nResearch Clusters\nCurrent Student Research Opportunities\nBiology Facilities\nCollaborative Research\nWeekly Seminars\nCommunity\nBiodiversity Inventory\nContact Us\nPositions Available\nNews and Events\nNews\nArchive\nEvents\nAlumni\nSupport Biology\nAlumni Newsletter\nMENU\nAbout Us\nPeople\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nResearch\nCommunity\nNews and Events\nAlumni\nHome\nGraduate\nGraduate Studies\nBiology at Western offers research-intensive, thesis-based graduate training at the Masters and Doctoral levels. We study life from a variety of perspectives including ecology and evolution, molecular and cellular biology, and physiology and biochemistry. We offer a stimulating and collegial training environment, world-class facilities, guaranteed funding to students in good academic standing throughout their normal program duration, and high-profile research opportunities overseen by internationally-recognized faculty.\nFuture Students\nCurrent Students\nStudent Life\nMEET: ARANYA NAGAR\nAranya is an MSc Candidate in the Department of Biology at Western University.\nMEET: MATHEUS SANITA LIMA\nMatheus is a PhD Candidate in the Department of Biology at Western University.\n\u00a9 1878 - Western Univer